WEBVTT

00:04:59.736 --> 00:05:02.025
She is supposed to be silent

00:05:02.025 --> 00:05:05.196
and she is supposed to accept the decisions

00:05:05.196 --> 00:05:07.416
of her father and mother

00:05:07.416 --> 00:05:10.641
and the decisions of elders,

00:05:10.641 --> 00:05:13.047
even if she does not like them.

00:05:13.047 --> 00:05:16.376
If she is married to a man she doesn't like

00:05:16.376 --> 00:05:19.118
or if she is married to an old man,

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:20.678
she has to accept,

00:05:20.678 --> 00:05:23.196
because she does not want to be dubbed

00:05:23.196 --> 00:05:25.819
as disobedient.

00:05:25.819 --> 00:05:27.451
If she is married very early,

00:05:27.451 --> 00:05:28.925
she has to accept.

00:05:28.925 --> 00:05:32.947
Otherwise, she will be called disobedient.